  "method": "Execute the original interactive Accounts consent-URL owner offline.\n\nWhole original owner0x1003031ac runs with a synthetic live weak owner,\nmode2, profile strings and successful id-token-provider result. It executes\nnative query-pair construction, branch selection and URI serialization.\nThe final original browser-open operation captures its URL instead of opening\nanything. Public allocation, memory/string/stream/C-locale primitives and an\nuncontended weak-lock provider are substituted; the diagnostic-state accessor\nreturns its explicit input. No URL, query, encoding or authentication decision\nis supplied by the oracle. No browser, profile, account or network is used.\n",
